      820   DEFINE FRAME F-Main
      821        fi-date-start AT ROW 2 COL 9 COLON-ALIGNED
      822        fi-date-end AT ROW 2 COL 44 COLON-ALIGNED
      823        fi-time-start AT ROW 3 COL 9 COLON-ALIGNED
      824        fi-time-end AT ROW 3 COL 44 COLON-ALIGNED
