     1003   PROCEDURE adm-add-record :
     1004       MESSAGE "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
     1005          "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Add.":U
     1006          VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
     1007       RETURN.
     1008   END PROCEDURE.
