     1011          "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
     1012            "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Assign.":U
     1013              VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
     1014      RETURN.
     1015     END PROCEDURE.
